Why: Refuse a Notepad launch while Notepad shows a window this helper did not open: Windows Notepad keeps all its windows in one process and opens a file as a tab inside a window it already shows (it has no switch for a window of its own), so the file would land in the user's window, and while Notepad is in front Windows lets it bring a new window in front of the user's work. Windows the helper's own Notepad launches opened stay reusable.

